### 1. Register donor (expect 201)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Donor",
  "email": "donor@test.com",
  "password": "Test1234",
  "phone": "9999999999",
  "role": "donor"
}

### 2. Register as admin (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hacker",
  "email": "hacker@test.com",
  "password": "Test1234",
  "role": "admin"
}

### 3. NGO without organizationName (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test NGO",
  "email": "ngo@test.com",
  "password": "Test1234",
  "role": "ngo"
}

### 4. NGO with organizationName (expect 201, pending)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test NGO",
  "email": "ngo@test.com",
  "password": "Test1234",
  "role": "ngo",
  "organizationName": "Helping Hands"
}

### 5. Login (expect 200 and a token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "donor@test.com",
  "password": "Test1234"
}

### 6. /me without a token (expect 401)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/me

### 7. /me with a token (paste the token from test 5)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE